# Hailo-8 HEF artefacts.
#
# Checksums only - no HEF is committed to this repository, and nothing has been
# uploaded to the CDN yet. The deploy steps name the CDN path, verify against
# these lines, and carry a TODO(CDN) saying the file must be placed on the
# device by hand until the upload happens.
#
